  "sections": [
    {
      "name": "Verse 1",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[F/C]I need Thee [Gm/Bb]precious [Dm/A]Jesus,",
        "[Dm/A]For [Gm/D]I am [F/C]verypoor;",
        "[C]Astranger [C7]and a [F/C]pilgrim,",
        "[Gm/Bb]I [Dm/A]have no earthly [Gm]store.",
        "[Dm/A]I need the [Db]love [Dbdim]of [F/C]Jesus",
        "[F/A]To [Dm]cheer me [Db]on [Dbdim]my [F/C]way,",
        "[C7/G]To guide my doubting [Bb]foot [C]steps,",
        "[C7]To [F/C]be my [Gm/Bb]strength and [Dm/A]stay."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[F/C]I need the heart of Jesus [Gm/Bb]to feel each [Dm/A]anxious care,",
        "[C]To tell my every [C7]trial, and all my [F/C]sorrows [Gm/Bb]share.",
        "[F/A]I need the [Dm]Holy Spirit [Db]to teach [Dbdim]me what [F/C]I am,",
        "[C7]To show me [F/C]more of Jesus, [Gm/Bb]to point me to [Dm/A]the Lamb."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[F/C]I need Thee precious Jesus, [Gm/Bb]I hope to [Dm/A]see Thee soon,",
        "[C]Encircled with the rainbow, [C7]and seated [F/C]on Thy [Gm/Bb]throne.",
        "[F/A]There with Thy [Dm]blood-bought children, [Db]my joy [Dbdim]shall ever [F/C]be",
        "[C7]To sing Thy [F/C]ceaseless praises, [Gm/Bb]to gaze, my Lord, [Dm/A]on Thee."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "meter": "7.6.7.6.D."
